                <mxCell id="ctxBody" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" value="Acme Fibre · broadband · Pune&lt;br&gt;About 1,200 support emails a day&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EDEDED&quot;&gt;Trust comes first:&lt;br&gt;— never break a policy (OTP, password, credit limits)&lt;br&gt;— never answer an email that needs a human&lt;br&gt;— get the facts right&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Email is not chat: minutes are fine.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C8C8C8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Scope: 84 cases (40 need a human) · one run · qwen3:4b · temperature 0&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
