                <mxCell id="evNote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#C8C8C8;" value="± 2 se · 84 cases · top failure category added after day 10" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="20" width="500" x="440" y="334" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="evReadLabel" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#D0D0D0;" value="WHAT IT SAYS" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="20" width="500" x="440" y="384" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="evRead" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#EDEDED;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pass rates overlap.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; They cannot pick a winner. Safety can.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;A and B miss almost every escalation.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; C catches 23 of 40, but breaks a policy in 8 replies (B 6, A 0).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;B is flattered.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; It got the articles for the expected intent (oracle context). C had to search: facts 36% against B's 74%.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;C is too slow for one Mac.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; 1,200 emails × 104 s ≈ 35 hours of compute a day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost is not the issue.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; B ≈ ₹1.60 a day, C ≈ ₹10 a day." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="330" width="500" x="440" y="414" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>

